mark draft

# Shelved by term-find-0065: superseded by find/tool.tree (decision 004). To delete.
# The backend contract (spec section 7): a backend is a VALUE of the form `find-backend`, built with `make`, never a
# keyword. It declares the kinds it can find, the query parts it executes itself (what a driver answers in `hello`),
# the backend it runs inside, and the driver it speaks to. The form is `find-backend`, not `find-tool`: the user's
# word is backend and the handle already names its `backend` (item 0061). The registry and mounting are item 0011.

# how a capability is performed (spec section 11): the app's own API, the accessibility tree, or synthetic input
form find-rung
  mark text
  case meaning
  case access
  case input

form find-call-support
  link name, like text
  link rung, like find-rung
  link mark, like text

form find-kind-support
  link name, like text
  link have
    like list
      like text
  link like
    like list
      like text
  link call
    like list
      like find-call-support

form find-backend
  link name, like text
  link kind
    like list
      like find-kind-support
  link part
    like list
      like text
  link base, like text
  link driver, like text
